### Test 1 : Tous les événements (sans filtre)
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20

### Test 2 : Filtre date = today
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20&date=today

### Test 3 : Filtre date = week
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20&date=week

### Test 4 : Filtre date = month
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20&date=month

### Test 5 : Recherche "Paris"
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20&q=Paris

### Test 6 : Recherche "Paris" + date = week
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20&q=Paris&date=week

### Test 7 : Recherche "Paris" + date = month
GET http://localhost:8080/events?page=1&size=20&q=Paris&date=month

